<view class="page {{theme}}"><text class="eyebrow">READ ACROSS LANGUAGES</text><view class="title">全文翻译</view><view wx:if="{{!available}}" class="info">{{reason}}</view><view class="chips"><button class="chip" data-target="zh" bindtap="onTarget">{{target === 'zh' ? '✓ ' : ''}}译为中文</button><button class="chip" data-target="en" bindtap="onTarget">{{target === 'en' ? '✓ ' : ''}}译为英文</button><button class="chip" bindtap="onCapture">拍照 / 语音输入</button></view><textarea class="field source" value="{{text}}" bindinput="onInput" maxlength="6000" placeholder="输入或粘贴需要翻译的完整文本…"/><button class="primary" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy || !available}}" bindtap="onTranslate">翻译全文</button><view wx:if="{{translation}}" class="card result"><view class="row"><text class="eyebrow">译文</text><button class="text-button" bindtap="onCopy">复制</button></view><text selectable="true" class="translation">{{translation}}</text><view wx:if="{{incomplete}}" class="info">模型输出达到长度上限，译文未完整结束。请拆分原文后重试。</view></view><view wx:if="{{history.length}}"><view class="section-head"><text class="section-title">本机翻译记录</text></view><view class="card"><button wx:for="{{history}}" wx:key="created" class="word-row" data-index="{{index}}" bindtap="onHistory"><text class="source-preview">{{item.source}}</text></button></view></view><view class="footer">全文翻译通过你配置的模型服务生成；查词仍直接使用词库。本机历史最多保留最近 30 次。</view></view>
